  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81b9501dec89da64eb81f4c230bdd187, type: 3}
  m_Name: Truth Serum
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HoneyAndHemlock.Customers.CustomerSO
  _requestedPotion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 272dbb0c4211275439f904283a113532, type: 2}
  _request:
  - A traveling merchant sold my wife a Tidebreaker Mare he swore was a purebred,
    but the mare's got patches and a limp. I need to sit him down and get him to
    admit to pulling a fast one!
  - Someone in the village has been stealing from the offering shrine at night. I
    know it's one of the three families on Dreamweft Hill but none of them will say
    a word. I need one of them to talk.
  _playerResponse:
  - Let's expose the lie
  - Someone's hiding something
  _successfulResponse:
  - He confessed. Right there in the square, in front of the whole village. Spilled
    everything. Turns out he's been running this scam across three towns. Well done,
    potion maker. Well done.
  - "It was the mage\u2019s husband. He cracked the moment I offered him a sip. Told
    me everything, even things I didn't ask about. That potion is terrifyingly effective."
  _failedResponse:
  - It did the opposite. Now everyone around him is spilling their secrets instead.
    The butcher just told me about something he did twelve years ago that I really
    didn't need to know.
  - "It worked on everyone EXCEPT the thieves. Now the weaver admitted she\u2019s
    been using fae thread without a license. Everyone\u2019s talking except for anyone
    from the three families!"
  _cosmicResponse:
  - "Something ancient saw right through me. All of me. That was terrifying\u2026
    I\u2019ll feel better when I get that merchant to talk."
  - Something saw through me completely. All my secrets. Someone's still stealing
    from the shrine though. I need help finding answers.
